{"id":"624108","name":"蒲公英鸡蛋饼","author":"我叫大栾栾","authorId":"12899458","desc":"","cover":"images/624108/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"蒲公英","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好所需食材，蒲公英去根洗净。","img":"images/624108/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋打散。","img":"images/624108/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒲公英水开焯水半分钟。","img":"images/624108/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞出挤干水分，切碎。","img":"images/624108/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切碎的蒲公英放入蛋液中。","img":"images/624108/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"ml量勺为准，加半勺盐。","img":"images/624108/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"半勺生抽。","img":"images/624108/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"一勺蚝油。","img":"images/624108/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"四勺清水搅拌均匀。","img":"images/624108/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"锅中油烧热，倒入蛋液，小火煎。","img":"images/624108/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻面再煎一下。","img":"images/624108/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"出锅，切块。","img":"images/624108/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"开动吧。","img":"images/624108/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"煎蛋的时候一定要用小火煎哦。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}